									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>Što samo 1 vodomat kad ceo grad nema vode?</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-256077" data-commentid="256077" data-postid="138929" data-belowelement="div-comment-256077" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Odgovor za Ptr" aria-label="Odgovor za Ptr">Odgovori</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-256539" class="comment odd alt depth-3 parent">
			<article id="div-comment-256539" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/01e0bcf9423eb48622750f011d4161f79775c6b2fe9c9c8bb5c365b85c5cdbc7?s=32&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/01e0bcf9423eb48622750f011d4161f79775c6b2fe9c9c8bb5c365b85c5cdbc7?s=64&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>						<b class="fn">Milan Topalov</b> <span class="says">kaže:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://zrenjaninski.com/grad/postavljen-prvi-javni-vodomat-u-gradu-litar-vode-kosta-pet-dinara/#comment-256539"><time datetime="2022-02-14T20:41:12+01:00">14/02/2022 u 20:41</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>&#8222;Ukoliko voda nije hlorisana, reverzna osmoza nije u stanju da ukloni arsen&#8220;.<br />
<a href="https://hydrolux.info/english/tehnologije/uklanjanje-arsena.htm" rel="nofollow ugc">https://hydrolux.info/english/tehnologije/uklanjanje-arsena.htm</a><br />
POZDRAV IZ ELEMIRA!</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-256539" data-commentid="256539" data-postid="138929" data-belowelement="div-comment-256539" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Odgovor za Milan Topalov" aria-label="Odgovor za Milan Topalov">Odgovori</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		<ol class="children">
		<li id="comment-256568" class="comment even depth-4">
			<article id="div-comment-256568" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b65f58b61a97b2d69a3fc1413512a4f600cbbf200c39536756dfbe82ee7b5c87?s=32&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b65f58b61a97b2d69a3fc1413512a4f600cbbf200c39536756dfbe82ee7b5c87?s=64&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>						<b class="fn"><a href="http://Beograd" class="url" rel="ugc external nofollow">Nenad</a></b> <span class="says">kaže:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://zrenjaninski.com/grad/postavljen-prvi-javni-vodomat-u-gradu-litar-vode-kosta-pet-dinara/#comment-256568"><time datetime="2022-02-14T22:24:01+01:00">14/02/2022 u 22:24</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

				<div class="comment-content">
					<p>Voda naravno sadrži hlor, koji se uklanja u prvoj fazi ovog prečišćavanja. Uspešna primena membranskih metoda pri uklanjanju arsena zavisi od pravilnog izbora<br />
membrane koja mora odgovarati karakteristikama vode koja se obrađuje, obliku u<br />
kojem arsen dolazi (As (III) ili As (V); otopljen ili zasebno, Kao i  prisutnosti organske i<br />
anorganske materija. Pri uklanjanju arsena (III) i arsena(V) pogodne su dve metode i to<br />
reverzna osmoza (RO) i nanofiltracija (NF) uz prethodnu oksidaciju. Obe metode su<br />
jednako uspešne pri uklanjanju arsena(V), oko 95 %, dok se arsen(III) uklanja RO<br />
oko 87 %, a NF od 40 do 74 %, na to utiče veličina i naelektrisanje molekula kao i brzina<br />
proticanja vode kroz sistem (Izvor: Stanić i Kuleš,2005.).</p>
				</div><!-- .comment-content -->

				<div class="reply"><a rel="nofollow" class="comment-reply-link" href="#comment-256568" data-commentid="256568" data-postid="138929" data-belowelement="div-comment-256568" data-respondelement="respond" data-replyto="Odgovor za Nenad" aria-label="Odgovor za Nenad">Odgovori</a></div>			</article><!-- .comment-body -->
		</li><!-- #comment-## -->
</ol><!-- .children -->
</li><!-- #comment-## -->
		<li id="comment-263133" class="comment odd alt depth-3">
			<article id="div-comment-263133" class="comment-body">
				<footer class="comment-meta">
					<div class="comment-author vcard">
						<img alt='' src='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35bf36b0465c269eeee990e81e78d936b16c6da334a56b9d15019e30f48e1f4e?s=32&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g' srcset='https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/35bf36b0465c269eeee990e81e78d936b16c6da334a56b9d15019e30f48e1f4e?s=64&#038;d=mm&#038;r=g 2x' class='avatar avatar-32 photo' height='32' width='32' loading='lazy' decoding='async'/>						<b class="fn">Vera</b> <span class="says">kaže:</span>					</div><!-- .comment-author -->

					<div class="comment-metadata">
						<a href="https://zrenjaninski.com/grad/postavljen-prvi-javni-vodomat-u-gradu-litar-vode-kosta-pet-dinara/#comment-263133"><time datetime="2022-03-08T22:17:13+01:00">08/03/2022 u 22:17</time></a>					</div><!-- .comment-metadata -->

									</footer><!-- .comment-meta -->

